message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: Gatewright
abstract: "Gatewright is an open-source PMO harness for programmes that run on gates - capital projects, integrations, transformations, product programmes. It connects your schedule tool, planner, mailbox and document store, scores each gate against a configurable gate model, runs chasers and forecasts, and exposes everything as MCP tools."
type: software
authors:
